            <ArticleTitle>[Arthroscopy scapulothoracic articulation (introduction of this method)].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>141-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors have introduced arthroscopy of scapulothoracic. They have treated 37 years old patient who suffer from bursitis with pain and crepitus. They have used arthroscopy procedure. The first publication about scapulothoracic arthroscopy was in 1992. The method has been written very rarely by foreigner authors in medical journals.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
